msgid "Playworks North is a Montreal studio making games and apps."
msgstr ""
"Playworks North est un studio montréalais qui crée des jeux et des "
"applications."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

msgid "Montreal"
msgstr "Montréal"

msgid "Playworks North Studio"
msgstr "Studio Playworks North"

msgid "Games and apps, made in Montreal."
msgstr "Des jeux et des applications, faits à Montréal."

msgid ""
"Playworks North is a studio building games and apps that are fun to play and "
"pleasant to use, and we ship them. Available for contract and collaboration "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Playworks North est un studio qui crée des jeux et des applications amusants "
"à jouer et agréables à utiliser, et qui les livre. Disponible pour des "
"contrats et des collaborations."

